      ],
      "source": "https://stratfordwi.gov/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Stratford began as a company town settled primarily by lumberjacks and farmers during the late nineteenth century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://stratfordwi.gov/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The village of Stratford was platted in 1891 when the railroad was extended to that point.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
